  "description": "GOMHAT crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C77 H88 Mn2 N9 O20 Tb3 2+,3(C1 H4 O1),Cl1 O4 1-,N1 O3 1-,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 4 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.386-3.839 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.74-113.84°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [MnIII2Tb3(LH)4(NO3)(HOCH3)]ClO4·NO3·3CH3OH·H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
